#+TITLE: Native EPURE shutdown leaves save dialogs and output callbacks active
#+STATUS: NEXT
#+PRIORITY: P1
#+TYPE: bug
#+DEPENDS: native Windows CAD qualification
#+BRANCH: codex/fermeture-cao-20261023

* Reproduction
Run installed SCHME or SCHMS under ALFE on AutoCAD 2022 or BricsCAD V25
with EPURE. Successful assertions can be followed by a Dessin1 save dialog,
a forced BricsCAD termination, or an AutoCAD callback error during shutdown.

* Findings and corrections under qualification
- Keep native printers until the entire protocol server loop and its final
  logging finish, then restore them. Restoring at C:MAIN return is too early.
- Close AutoCAD documents without saving, wait for quiescence and retry
  transient COM rejections. Never Quit after a failed document close.
- Close the active BricsCAD batch document explicitly with SaveChanges=False
  before QUIT; even AutoLISP command with a discard answer leaves a dialog
  on SCHME. Allow bounded natural exit before fallback.

* Evidence (2026-10-23)
34 targeted checks pass on both SBCL and CCL, including ownership, bridge generation,
protocol restoration ordering and bounded process shutdown. Windows cscript
mocks show retry success and refusal to Quit after permanent close failure.
SCHMS on pb: 3 assertions pass and BricsCAD exits naturally with code 0
using the isolated qualification plugin. Further native account/project
qualification is still pending; no full-matrix success is claimed.

* Additional lifecycle finding
On this Windows host, GetExitCodeProcess can return 47806 and .NET
Process.HasExited can be true while WaitForSingleObject(handle, 0) returns
WAIT_TIMEOUT and Restart Manager still lists the process as a DLL owner.
Native qualification must use the process handle signal, not only the
reported exit code. The operational collector now has that stronger test.

SCHME on pb: 5 assertions pass and BricsCAD exits naturally with code 0
using explicit ActiveDocument.Close(False), isolated plugin V12.
The preceding V11 matrix passed SCHMS on both engines, but SCHME BricsCAD
needed forced termination and SCHME AutoCAD exited with 0xc0020001.
Those V11 SCHME rows remain failed qualification.

Full pb matrix (V13 plugin): SCHME 5/5 and SCHMS 3/3 on both engines,
Make=0 throughout, BricsCAD native exit=0 and AutoCAD native exit=47806
with signaled process handles. Release document references and wait for
idle again after Close(False), before Quit. 37 targeted checks pass on
both SBCL and CCL. Runner matrices are still pending.

* Private drawing correction (2026-10-23)
The BricsCAD batch argv builder used only the template cached at backend
detection, which normally is NIL. It never called workdir-aware discovery,
so the promised private empty.dwg was missing from batch launches. Resolve
the default drawing after the session workdir exists, preserving explicit
template overrides. A regression stages two Windows batch sessions and
checks that both drawings exist at distinct paths. This fixes the batch
default; the origin of reported cadinst-bricscad-A/B names is still under
investigation and is not attributed to this code without evidence.
